flowchart TD
  A[Request arrives] --> G{Over the rate limit?}
  G -- yes --> R429[429 + Retry-After]
  G -- no --> B{Authenticated?}
  B -- no / bad token --> R401[401 Unauthorized]
  B -- yes --> C{Allowed to do this?}
  C -- no --> R403[403 Forbidden<br/>or 404 to hide existence]
  C -- yes --> D{Well-formed and valid?}
  D -- no --> R400[400 Bad Request<br/>422 if valid syntax, invalid meaning]
  D -- yes --> E{Resource exists?}
  E -- no --> R404[404 Not Found]
  E -- yes --> F{Conflicts with current state?}
  F -- yes --> R409[409 Conflict<br/>412 if If-Match failed]
  F -- no --> OK[2xx: 200 · 201 + Location · 202 · 204]
